<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Entitlements for Developer-ID + notarized builds (backlog Phase 6).

  Intentionally minimal / non-sandboxed: this app is distributed via GitHub releases, not the
  Mac App Store, so App Sandbox is not required — only a valid Developer ID signature + Hardened
  Runtime (`codesign --options runtime`) are needed for notarization. The app has zero SPM
  dependencies (Package.swift has no `dependencies:` entries) and only links Apple system
  frameworks (AppKit/SwiftUI/SceneKit/Foundation/CoreGraphics), so no Hardened Runtime exceptions
  (JIT, unsigned executable memory, disabled library validation, etc.) are needed today. Extend
  this file if a future feature needs one (e.g. network access for an update checker).
-->
